1
00:00:00,278 --> 00:00:04,248
(Sheldon:)No, I went to punch
the water fountain,

2
00:00:04,248 --> 00:00:06,448
(Sheldon:)slipped in water in front
of the water fountain,

3
00:00:06,451 --> 00:00:09,551
(Sheldon:)and hit my head
on the water fountain.

4
00:00:09,554 --> 00:00:12,384
(Bernadette:)I can't imagine you
being violent.

5
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,590
(Leonard:)It's not hard.
Just picture the Three Stooges,

6
00:00:14,592 --> 00:00:16,862
(Leonard:)and then take away two stooges.

7
00:00:17,996 --> 00:00:20,396
(Sheldon:)I'm so disappointed
in myself.

8
00:00:20,398 --> 00:00:22,968
(Sheldon:)Jealousy is
completely illogical.

9
00:00:22,967 --> 00:00:24,537
(Raj:)It's a human
emotion, Sheldon.

10
00:00:24,535 --> 00:00:25,905
(Raj:)Everyone gets jealous.

11
00:00:25,903 --> 00:00:27,603
(Raj:)I'm jealous of
Leonard and Penny

12
00:00:27,605 --> 00:00:28,635
(Raj:)and Howard and Bernadette

13
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,410
(Raj:)for being in such
happy relationships.

14
00:00:30,408 --> 00:00:33,278
(Amy:)What about me and Sheldon?

15
00:00:35,246 --> 00:00:36,446
(Bernadette:)Sure.

16
00:00:39,951 --> 00:00:41,981
(Leonard:)I've always been jealous
of how much money

17
00:00:41,986 --> 00:00:43,786
(Leonard:)Raj's family has.

18
00:00:43,788 --> 00:00:45,518
(Raj:)Thank you for saying that.
Next to buying things,

19
00:00:45,523 --> 00:00:48,493
(Raj:)that is the best part
about having money.

20
00:00:48,493 --> 00:00:50,323
(Amy:)Ever since I met Penny,

21
00:00:50,328 --> 00:00:52,328
(Amy:)I've been envious
of her looks.

22
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:54,530
(Penny:)Aw, thank you.

23
00:00:54,532 --> 00:00:56,362
(Amy:)That's why I was so happy
when you cut your hair off.

24
00:00:56,367 --> 00:00:57,437
What?!

25
00:00:57,435 --> 00:00:59,065
(Amy:)You know what I mean.

